<p style="text-align: center;"><strong>Meaghan Beatley, <a href="https://bookshop.org/a/40/9780143138440" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="external"><em>Sex and Dissent: Stories of Feminist Resistance in Argentina, Chile, Mexico, and Spain</em></a></strong><br />
<strong>(Penguin)</strong></p>
